---
// AnnotatedRecord — fictional IC memo with Memric's typed intelligence in the right margin.
// Ported verbatim from the approved mockup (judgment-forward.html .doc-wrap block).
---
<div class="mx-auto max-w-[1180px] px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-14">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 mt-[46px] border-t-2 border-ink">
    <!-- Document column -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 py-[28px] lg:pr-[34px] lg:border-r border-b lg:border-b-0 border-hairline">
      <div class="font-mono text-[10.5px] tracking-[0.06em] uppercase text-graytext mb-[14px]">IC MEMO / NVDA INITIATION / 2023-Q3</div>
      <h3 class="text-[20px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] mb-[14px]">Initiating a 4% position in NVIDIA</h3>
      <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.66] text-bodytext mb-[12px] max-w-[54ch]">The thesis rests on data-center GPU demand outrunning supply through at least 2025<sup aria-describedby="anno-1" class="font-mono text-accent text-[10px] font-semibold">1</sup>, with the CUDA software moat insulating gross margins from commoditization.<sup aria-describedby="anno-2" class="font-mono text-accent text-[10px] font-semibold">2</sup></p>
      <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.66] text-bodytext mb-[12px] max-w-[54ch]">We hold that <del class="line-through decoration-accent text-struck">AI-infrastructure margins are structurally durable</del> as hyperscaler capex compounds. The principal risk is in-house silicon compressing the moat faster than the market expects.<sup aria-describedby="anno-3" class="font-mono text-accent text-[10px] font-semibold">3</sup></p>
    </div>

    <!-- Margin annotations column -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 py-[28px] lg:pl-[30px]">
      <!-- Annotation 1: Prediction resolved -->
      <div id="anno-1" class="grid grid-cols-[18px_1fr] gap-[12px] py-[15px] border-b border-hairline pt-0">
        <div class="font-mono text-[12px]">1</div>
        <div>
          <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.06em] uppercase text-graytext mb-[5px]">Prediction · resolved ✓</div>
          <div class="text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-bodytext">Demand outran supply through 2024-Q4. Author calibration <strong class="font-semibold">+0.8σ</strong>.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Annotation 2: Principle retired -->
      <div id="anno-2" class="grid grid-cols-[18px_1fr] gap-[12px] py-[15px] border-b border-hairline">
        <div class="font-mono text-[12px] text-accent">2</div>
        <div>
          <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.06em] uppercase text-graytext mb-[5px]">Principle PRI-0042 · <strong class="font-semibold text-accent">retired</strong></div>
          <div class="text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-bodytext">Superseded 2025-Q3 by the NVDA post-mortem.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Annotation 3: Dissent correct -->
      <div id="anno-3" class="grid grid-cols-[18px_1fr] gap-[12px] py-[15px] border-b border-hairline">
        <div class="font-mono text-[12px] text-correct">3</div>
        <div>
          <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.06em] uppercase text-graytext mb-[5px]">Dissent · J. Okafor · <strong class="font-semibold text-correct">correct</strong></div>
          <div class="text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-bodytext">Flagged silicon risk <strong class="font-semibold">14 months</strong> before it priced in.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Disclosure line -->
  <p class="mx-auto max-w-[1180px] px-0 mt-3 text-[12px] text-graytext font-mono">Illustrative example. Memric runs on your firm&rsquo;s own documents.</p>
</div>
